      "quotes": [
        {
          "text": "With the advent of Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) and data warehouses, there are many industry standard data or information models that are available that could be useful in creating your business capability catalog. Most conceptual data models are a collection of business objects with relationships between them. The following view of business objects (Figure 4-4) provides the basis for a simplified retail conceptual data model.",
          "source_block_ids": [
