      "page_markdown": "documents/G233.md#page-28",
      "quotes": [
        {
          "text": "Armed with an application catalog and the conceptual data model, the assessment of how information is exchanged both transactionally and operationally can be completed. It is important to look at all forms of information exchange. At this level of analysis the mechanism by which the data is moved between applications is not as relevant.",
          "source_block_ids": [
            "G233:p0028:b002",
            "G233:p0028:b003",
            "G233:p0028:b004",
